DOS GUI Library for C.  Full Large model
library is provided for BorlandC, MixC
and MicrosoftC compilers.  Capabilities
are : mouse support,Pull down menu,
graphics functions, window functions,
button functions, text and binary fields,
scrollable menu, scroll bar function,
percentage bar display function, and
hyper text help facility. Full documentation
is provided within the DEMO.EXE 'HELP'

